      "message": "For now EC code limits the minimum timeout to 5 seconds (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/refs/heads/main/common/ap_hang_detect.c#79) and the max limit is set by the size of the `reboot_timeout_sec` field (uint16_t).",
